Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt your conquerors, Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It resonated through your every punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.94,0:00:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The technique was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But the execution was sorely lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep coming at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Another pirate who couldn't be\NJoy Boy, just like the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Within brings out a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.42,0:01:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All we saw, stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.06,0:01:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\NWere about to collapse?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,To the compass in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:02:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain. So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,your eyes and breathe in\Ndeeply and listen to your soul
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll see a path in front of you and\Nyou'll know just where you need to go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.10,0:02:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so stand up tall reach\Nout your hand cut through
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the wind and make a stand\Ndon't let the darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll do it my own way that's\Nwhat's best for me and you do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it your way that's how it's\Ngot to be we're moving forward
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,now i'm ready but at times it's\Nokay to get help on the way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,for the future ahead burning\Nbright for what's ahead you see
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,is beyond your wildest dreams so
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,stand up tall reach out your hand cut
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:03:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,through the wind and make a stand don't\Nlet the darkness win just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll do it our way the best that we\Nknow with tears and doubts and tone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll go where we all wanna go the\Npage within brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Raccoon, get wrecked!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He grabbed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:03:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.42,0:04:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's overpowering Twain! That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, quite so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're breathing awfully hard, Raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're winning\Nthis, or was that all for show?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pick it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power is lickety-spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:04:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Or for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've sure been hard to\Ntrack down, young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come quietly, we don't want to fight. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.22,0:05:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Bobonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's got that smug look in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The young master's handcuffs are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kozuki Udon, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.86,0:05:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.88,0:05:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot meet my end yet. Meet your end?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.56,0:05:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent someone, but who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess who we found, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.06,0:06:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okie Dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.04,0:06:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We relay a message to all\Nof Onigashima, Bauhuang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them my battle\Nagainst Straw Hat is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in struggling any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's firing again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Take cover or you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.00,0:06:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere left to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.40,0:06:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, Amon, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got less than ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,then my Rumble Ball's power will wear off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's longer than before,\Nbut it's still not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really the best you can do? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Three minutes is no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems a little half-assed, in my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I'm a monster for more than ten\Nminutes, there might be side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But who gives a damn?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What, do you only care about yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Some pirate you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fetch me the chemicals I ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The gigantification will\Nbe extended to 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ten times longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's risky, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're not scared, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a pirate, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:08:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Black coffee beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to sneak away?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.76,0:08:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mary's!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, Diffusion Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have your attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel is over, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy with the highest bounty, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Loopy himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,has been defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:08:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopperman, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.56,0:09:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Kaido just\Ntook the life out of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, a-s-f!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Straw Hat Luffy sank like a rock,\Ndeeper and deeper into the dark, dark sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha! Good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.98,0:09:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.34,0:09:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the idiot drown for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki samurai are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's left?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Can anyone else step up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone strong enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He stopped the samurai too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.23,0:10:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Kaido is coming\Ndownstairs to clean out his castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that giant hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.66,0:10:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for nothing more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But the good news is, our final\Nleader will accept your surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is\Nbe nice and obedient,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,put your hands in the air,\Nand promise not to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you'll be welcomed\Nas a member of our crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And we won't have to kill you! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.98,0:10:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke! What is it? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.52,0:11:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to tell everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender, Land of Waddle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a losing battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.98,0:11:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me say it again for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy was defeated and sank\Nto the bottom of the dark, dark sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This frog is a Mary, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.18,0:11:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's one in the room with\Nus, then it's already too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, anyone in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.42,0:12:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And Shinobu, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fine reunion this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.64,0:12:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu, he's not real.\NYou're here. You've returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.92,0:12:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the poor boy go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a heart-warming\Nreunion for our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like poor old Odin anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Cease your lies! You car!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You've mocked us enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, Kiku, that's rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.06,0:12:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you put that nasty sword away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still your lord, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.44,0:12:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster, you killed Arshina!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really me, Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't speak my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.22,0:13:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with his face! Kanjuro! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the thanks I get\Nafter all I did for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.62,0:13:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember the first meal I\Nshared with you and Izo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.12,0:13:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't bring yourself to do it, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, master. Key just as\Nhe said they couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have any trouble\Ncutting me down the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, we're both\Ncritically injured, Kiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Keen, I have failed\Nyou for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.32,0:14:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku Nojo of the Fallen Snow\Nshall meet her end this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if the fallen snow is melting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.62,0:15:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That means dawn is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,To shine on the land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well spoken, Kiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And that dawn will be so bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That it will shine upon our\Nfriends in the afterworld?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.84,0:15:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaku nojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If only we had an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.94,0:15:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely your performance\Nwould get a standing ovation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's time for\Nyour final scene, Keen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not. I'll set the stage\Nso that you die gloriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,His lord was killed and he was\Nbetrayed by his dear friend Long as he
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.96,0:16:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,fought and now his comrades fall\Nbefore him one by one What a tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps it's a comedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire audience is\Nwaiting in suspense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Decorate the stage with\Nyour dazzling death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.06,0:16:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.90,0:17:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not taking this freak in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you being so cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I was sorry over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What more do you want from me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjido!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, I've missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the sound that\NRaizo makes when he runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.18,0:17:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just another one of his many skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Nimpol. Blindfolding technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.72,0:17:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kanjido, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.52,0:17:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one else behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,oh, you trickster you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,aaaaagh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no one more suited to lower the\Ncurtain of my blade. I give you my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We shared this stage as\Nbest friends, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tale it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.08,0:18:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Master King.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.90,0:19:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, so this is where\Nyou scurried off to, little rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu, take Lord Momonosuke\Nand run away! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way, samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.94,0:19:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.66,0:19:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter the odds I face,\NI cannot let you pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.92,0:20:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.90,0:20:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be a lie, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.86,0:20:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.84,0:20:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not here,\Nthen it's all pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.34,0:20:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's been defeated, they said!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone left\Nwho can take out Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bao Huang's announcement filled\Nthe samurai with uncertainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.64,0:21:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And in an instant, their conviction\Nbegan to waver and give way to despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.64,0:21:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat was defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.16,0:21:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And Lord Momonosuke, is he safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy won't lose a fight that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.82,0:21:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.74,0:21:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigashima continues its\Njourney through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.38,0:21:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Soaring over the land of Wano, it\Ndraws ever closer to the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.52,0:22:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.70,0:22:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That little dumpling gave me\Njust the power boost I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.52,0:22:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't do too bad, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.44,0:22:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys you brought are tough as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.78,0:22:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The best pirates from\Ntheir generation for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.74,0:22:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't lose cause they're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.32,0:22:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.20,0:22:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause Commander Kaido\Nis just too damn strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.04,0:22:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Slicing rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.62,0:22:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kappa style.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.40,0:22:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,River of retribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Straw Hat is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.54,0:22:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up till Kaido is defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.58,0:22:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.58,0:22:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Our forces haven't confirmed\NStraw Hat's death yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They made that announcement\Nto crush everyone's
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.64,0:23:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,morale indeed true or not\Nthere's no way to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.54,0:23:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really pissing me off you\Nthink we're gonna lose that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.12,0:23:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't cry. Now, who's\Ngetting their ass kicked?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,all the time mr wreck we\Nhad a good thing going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.18,0:23:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you're crying on the\Nfloor like a big hairy baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The shepherd is slain, and now all\Nhis sheep are left to the wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That means it's time for a lickety feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:23:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How sweet it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.78,0:24:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.69,0:24:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he goes again!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.36,0:24:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Apocalyptic candy shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.16,0:24:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.38,0:24:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.58,0:24:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You sorry excuse for a monster,\Nyou're on the menu too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.60,0:24:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm, that meat looks nice and Drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.00,0:24:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Diablish, Umber!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.26,0:25:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Rotisserie strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.62,0:25:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.88,0:25:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You hung in there, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.92,0:25:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.66,0:26:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.57,0:26:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sufi...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.18,0:26:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.46,0:26:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.37,0:26:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He made miracles happen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.88,0:26:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.30,0:26:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.48,0:26:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.08,0:26:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.28,0:26:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.12,0:26:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.44,0:26:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.34,0:26:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he's back, he'll have\Nthe strength of ten men.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.98,0:26:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,More like 2,000 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.00,0:26:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.12,0:26:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll handle\Nthe stupid-looking dinosaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.48,0:27:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the one responsible for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.76,0:27:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Such his little reject!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.92,0:27:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fearless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.42,0:27:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like the tides haven't turned at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.54,0:27:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,His captain is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he even fighting for anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.02,0:27:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I miss something?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.34,0:27:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I like about you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.84,0:27:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.98,0:27:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.78,0:27:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.44,0:28:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.80,0:28:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't beaten me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.56,0:28:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not while I still draw breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.76,0:28:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a solemn vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.88,0:28:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not lay a finger\Non Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.98,0:28:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter the cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.52,0:28:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.66,0:28:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.18,0:28:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I make a humble suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.36,0:28:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This may be uncomfortable for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.10,0:29:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But from this day forth, call me father.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.78,0:29:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to pretend\Nthat you are my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.58,0:29:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.82,0:29:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is for your own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.50,0:29:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy must not know your identity;\Nthat you are Lord Odin's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.34,0:29:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As his descendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.80,0:29:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,they will surely target you to prevent the\NKozuki clan from ever returning to power.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.32,0:29:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.12,0:29:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then. Until this\Nbattle is over, call me son.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.64,0:29:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.76,0:29:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then call me father Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.10,0:29:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Kin'emon. I will.\NHey, you're still calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.36,0:29:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,him Lord you two really\Nare quite the hapless pair?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.62,0:30:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should engage in\Nsome training just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.54,0:30:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.45,0:30:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, momonosuke,\Nmomonosuke, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.26,0:30:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to grasp the concept, but\Nyou mess it up at the end every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.40,0:30:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.64,0:30:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Friend, you're not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.18,0:30:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.70,0:30:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too insolent for me to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.14,0:31:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Try harder! Keith!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.66,0:31:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Or father, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.56,0:31:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should be his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.88,0:31:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd much rather you be\Ninsolent than flatulent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.94,0:31:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My mouth was open!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.76,0:31:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, my lord, you must live.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.58,0:31:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of stalling for time?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.96,0:31:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere left for him to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.36,0:31:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up. Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.56,0:31:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We must protect our lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.76,0:31:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we live!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.90,0:31:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.32,0:31:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.06,0:32:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You must survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.02,0:32:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.62,0:32:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die gracefully samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.40,0:32:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to accept, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.62,0:32:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth will find you in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.38,0:33:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Robot. Huh? A frog?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.44,0:33:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.88,0:33:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.80,0:33:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.20,0:33:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.00,0:33:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beneath the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.98,0:33:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.00,0:33:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.60,0:33:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.42,0:33:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.46,0:33:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.32,0:33:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.06,0:33:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, I am Kozuki Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.80,0:33:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.96,0:33:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.50,0:33:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.52,0:34:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a message from Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.66,0:34:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.42,0:34:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like he's crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.66,0:34:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Kaido defeated Luffy Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.66,0:34:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.46,0:34:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear his voice now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.84,0:34:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And he promised me that he'll come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.14,0:34:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.30,0:34:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to keep fighting, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.84,0:34:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it may be painful, it may be hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.60,0:34:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I beg of you, as long as you\Nstill stand, you must keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.36,0:34:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If Lord Momonosuke wants\Nus to fight, let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.68,0:34:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we're still standing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.04,0:35:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.64,0:35:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.22,0:35:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.92,0:35:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.30,0:35:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.56,0:35:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat Kaido!
